      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'A "blessed" sacrifice requires 2 different bugs (Even if they are similar,
    say a fly and a horse fly, this will count as different). The modifiers of the
    right card will be added to the modifiers of the left card.


    For example,
    if the left card is a beetle with "armored" and the right is a fly with "dodge"
    the result will be a "blessed beetle" with armored and dodge as its modifiers.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
